    "body": "The cleanup used player position when the settled projectile had no position, then ignored returned copies more than 5 m away. It also refreshed the baseline during cleanup and could bless a late copy. Cleanup now protects the original baseline once and removes every new loose Ancient Tomahawk object/pickup from that throw, regardless of distance. Test ground, wall/tree and ped impacts.",
